flowchart LR

    A[Lead Source] --> B[n8n Intake]
    B --> C[Validate & Normalize]
    C --> D[(PostgreSQL Intake Ledger)]

    D --> E[Resolve Salesforce Lead Identity]

    E --> F[Data Readiness]
    F --> G[ICP Fit]
    G --> H[Buying Intent]
    H --> I[Qualification Decision]

    I --> J[Salesforce Lead]

    J --> K[Routing]
    K --> L[SLA Start]

    L --> M{Sales Engaged?}

    M -->|Yes| N[SLA Met]
    M -->|No / Deadline Passed| O[SLA Breach & Escalation]

    N --> P[Account / Contact Resolution]
    O --> P

    P --> Q{Existing Open Opportunity?}

    Q -->|Yes| R[Existing Opportunity Path]
    Q -->|No| S[Opportunity Candidate / Creation]

    R --> T[(Operational Audit)]
    S --> T

    B --> T
    C --> T
    I --> T
    K --> T
    L --> T
